## Installation

`defineProcessModule("alpha").withApi(AlphaModule).withTransports(alphaRest, alphaTrpc).withEventing(alphaEventing).withTasks(…)`, `src/alpha.module.ts:9`.

Installed by api, from each app's generated module list (`pnpm generate:modules`).

## Module API (`AlphaApi`)

Alpha's items.

Peers call these through the token, declared at `../contract/src/alpha.api.ts:3`; nothing else in this package is public.

#### `getItem`

```typescript
getItem(input: { id: string }): Promise<AlphaItem>;
```

