#### `GET /` · `listAlphaItems`

List the project's alpha items.

Permission `alpha:view`. Declared at `src/transport/alpha.rest.ts:22`.

Answers at `/api/alpha-items`, `/api/v1/alpha-items`; also, undocumented, `/api/alpha-items/2026-08-07`, `/api/v1/alpha-items/2026-08-07`, `/api/alpha-items/latest`, `/api/v1/alpha-items/latest`.

```typescript
// Response: z.array(alphaItemSchema) (inline, src/transport/alpha.rest.ts:24)
```

#### `GET /:id` · `getAlphaItem`

Public: a share link reads one item. Hidden from the OpenAPI document. Declared at `src/transport/alpha.rest.ts:30`.

Answers at `/api/alpha-items/:id`, `/api/v1/alpha-items/:id`; also, undocumented, `/api/alpha-items/2026-08-07/:id`, `/api/v1/alpha-items/2026-08-07/:id`, `/api/alpha-items/latest/:id`, `/api/v1/alpha-items/latest/:id`.

```typescript
type Params = z.infer<typeof alphaItemParams>; // ../contract/src/alpha.schemas.ts:8
```

