## Workers

### Pipeline `alpha_items` (aggregate `alpha_item`)

Declared at `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:12`. Events: `alphaItemAddedEventSchema`.

The chain builds early when `!input.process` (`src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:16`); the rows built only past that return say so. The caller's arguments decide which role gets which build.

| Kind                       | Name              | Handles                                                              | Declared at                         | Built                |
| -------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | -------------------- |
| command                    | `addItem`         | –                                                                    | `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:14` | always               |
| process manager            | `alphaSweep`      | every 1 min (`ALPHA_SWEEP_MS = 60 * 1000`); intents `sweep` (outbox) | `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:18` | past the early build |
| process manager            | `≈ input.process` | ≈ applier `input.process`                                            | `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:19` | past the early build |
| peer subscriber            | `gammaChanged`    | `lw.gamma.changed` from [gamma](../../gamma/README.md)               | `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:21` | past the early build |
| ClickHouse fold projection | `alphaItems`      | –                                                                    | `src/eventing/alpha.pipeline.ts:15` | always               |

